  "title": "Mind the Mood Gap",
  "description": "Plan for decisions when your emotions are neutral: - Pause before reacting: Delay decisions when you’re feeling overly emotional. - Simulate the other state: Ask yourself, \"What would I think about this when calm?\" - Reflect on patterns: Think back to times when emotions clouded your judgment. Example: Avoid impulsively quitting a job out of frustration—revisit the decision after a night's rest.",
